  "title": "Quantum ontology: systems in states that produce events",
  "statements": [
    {
      "id": "eed3f229-95db-4027-b634-e80b3217d2aa",
      "text": "The quantum axioms give an ontology of objects, which are systems in states, and the events they produce in other objects. A state is a disposition to produce events, and events, each tied to a projector, are the actual entities accessible in the third person.",
